{
  "$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#",
  "$id": "https://examleaf.local/schemas/v2/curriculum_framework.json",
  "title": "ExamLeaf Curriculum Framework v2",
  "description": "One board × stage × subject × medium framework in the CASE 1.1 information-model shape (Architecture §2.6), stored at content/curriculum/<id>.json and pinned as framework/<id>@x.y.z. Gate H-CG approves a version (bound as framework_version). Change class per §3.6 framework diff: removals and depth changes are Truth-class, text edits Metadata. Produced by the ingestion skill examleaf-curriculum-ingest (syllabus PDF → candidate items with spans → H-CG) or hand-authored (M1 step 1). Added 15 Oct 2026 (CE-111, level-1; P1-14: schema, fixtures and negative tests in CI before M1 step 1).",
  "$comment": "GUID rule (CE-111, 15 Oct 2026): guid = UUIDv5(namespace = UUIDv5(NS_URL, framework_id), name = human_code), lowercase hex. framework_id and human_code are edition-independent, so re-ingesting the same syllabus, or a new edition that keeps a code, returns the same GUIDs and the §3.6 framework diff runs per GUID; a GUID is never re-minted. Item GUIDs are unique within a framework (checked by the ingest linter; JSON Schema cannot express it). Commercial-term lint (CE-L1/RD-49; CE-26, CE-70; updated 15 Oct 2026): CI rejects, case-insensitively, any match of (price|pricing|paid|is_free|free_|premium|entitle|subscri|sku|paywall|unlock|monetis|monetiz|revenue|discount|coupon|tier|destination_resource|cta_destination|funnel|purchase_|checkout_|product_id|offer_|trial_|utm_|campaign_|affiliate_|activation_code|storefront) applied to every object key at every depth (including REN fields keys), every required entry, pattern key and enum or const value. Exempt: the editorial fields series_position, flagship and demo_kind, which carry no commercial meaning.",
  "type": "object",
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "definitions": {
    "sha256": {
      "type": "string",
      "pattern": "^[0-9a-f]{64}$"
    },
    "date": {
      "type": "string",
      "pattern": "^[0-9]{4}-[0-9]{2}-[0-9]{2}$"
    },
    "guid": {
      "type": "string",
      "pattern": "^[0-9a-f]{8}-[0-9a-f]{4}-5[0-9a-f]{3}-[89ab][0-9a-f]{3}-[0-9a-f]{12}$"
    },
    "source_span": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "Where in an official_curriculum SRC this text comes from (same shape as lesson_graph source_ref).",
      "properties": {
        "source_id": {
          "type": "string",
          "pattern": "^SRC-[A-Za-z0-9_.-]+$"
        },
        "locator": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1
        },
        "span_sha256": {
          "$ref": "#/definitions/sha256"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "source_id",
        "locator",
        "span_sha256"
      ]
    },
    "exam_window": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "Exam window (CE-122, level-3+, 15 Oct 2026). Inside a window touching an entry's affected set, GR releases only Revocation, Safety-tightening and S1 incident fixes.",
      "properties": {
        "name": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1
        },
        "start": {
          "$ref": "#/definitions/date"
        },
        "end": {
          "$ref": "#/definitions/date"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "name",
        "start",
        "end"
      ]
    },
    "item": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "guid": {
          "$ref": "#/definitions/guid"
        },
        "human_code": {
          "type": "string",
          "pattern": "^[A-Za-z0-9][A-Za-z0-9_.-]*$",
          "description": "Edition-independent code; the UUIDv5 name."
        },
        "kind": {
          "enum": [
            "competency",
            "learning_outcome",
            "topic"
          ]
        },
        "statement": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1
        },
        "parent_guid": {
          "$ref": "#/definitions/guid"
        },
        "associations": {
          "type": "array",
          "uniqueItems": true,
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "additionalProperties": false,
            "properties": {
              "type": {
                "enum": [
                  "prerequisite_of",
                  "crosswalk_equivalent",
                  "assessed_by_blueprint",
                  "non_evaluative"
                ]
              },
              "target_guid": {
                "$ref": "#/definitions/guid"
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "type",
              "target_guid"
            ]
          }
        },
        "dok": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1,
          "description": "Depth-of-knowledge level only when the framework publishes a rubric (§2.6); read by OBJ.dok_from_framework. A change is a depth change (Truth class)."
        },
        "source_span": {
          "$ref": "#/definitions/source_span"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "guid",
        "human_code",
        "kind",
        "statement",
        "source_span"
      ]
    }
  },
  "properties": {
    "framework_id": {
      "type": "string",
      "pattern": "^framework/[a-z0-9][a-z0-9_-]*$",
      "description": "Edition-independent (board × stage × subject × medium)."
    },
    "version": {
      "type": "string",
      "pattern": "^(0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(0|[1-9][0-9]*)$"
    },
    "hash_canon": {
      "const": "JCS-RFC8785+NFC"
    },
    "board": {
      "type": "string",
      "pattern": "^[a-z0-9][a-z0-9_-]*$"
    },
    "edition": {
      "type": "string",
      "minLength": 1
    },
    "stage": {
      "enum": [
        "foundational",
        "preparatory",
        "middle",
        "secondary",
        "higher_secondary",
        "undergraduate",
        "postgraduate",
        "adult",
        "vocational"
      ]
    },
    "subject": {
      "type": "string",
      "pattern": "^[a-z][a-z0-9_]*$"
    },
    "medium_locale": {
      "type": "string",
      "pattern": "^locale/[a-z0-9][a-z0-9_-]*$"
    },
    "valid_academic_years": {
      "type": "array",
      "minItems": 1,
      "uniqueItems": true,
      "items": {
        "type": "string",
        "pattern": "^[0-9]{4}-[0-9]{2}$"
      },
      "description": "Academic years (for example 2026-27) this edition serves (CE-116, level-2, 15 Oct 2026). Artefacts stay releasable for every edition still inside its window."
    },
    "exam_windows": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": {
        "$ref": "#/definitions/exam_window"
      },
      "uniqueItems": true
    },
    "source_refs": {
      "type": "array",
      "minItems": 1,
      "items": {
        "$ref": "#/definitions/source_span"
      },
      "description": "The syllabus text this framework was taken from. GR checks each SRC has reliability_class official_curriculum."
    },
    "ingestion": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "method": {
          "enum": [
            "examleaf-curriculum-ingest",
            "hand_authored"
          ]
        },
        "run_ref": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1
        },
        "authored_by": {
          "type": "string",
          "pattern": "^reviewer/[a-z0-9][a-z0-9_.-]*$"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "method"
      ],
      "allOf": [
        {
          "if": {
            "properties": {
              "method": {
                "const": "examleaf-curriculum-ingest"
              }
            }
          },
          "then": {
            "required": [
              "run_ref"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "if": {
            "properties": {
              "method": {
                "const": "hand_authored"
              }
            }
          },
          "then": {
            "required": [
              "authored_by"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "items": {
      "type": "array",
      "minItems": 1,
      "items": {
        "$ref": "#/definitions/item"
      }
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "framework_id",
    "version",
    "hash_canon",
    "board",
    "edition",
    "stage",
    "subject",
    "medium_locale",
    "valid_academic_years",
    "source_refs",
    "ingestion",
    "items"
  ]
}
